    <briefdescription>
<para>Lightweight <computeroutput>(<ref refid="varpower-monomial_8hpp_a157ac534e5ec3ea071fa7e5928ad2db5_1a157ac534e5ec3ea071fa7e5928ad2db5" kindref="member">varpower_monomial</ref>, <ref refid="struct_schreyer_frame_types_1_1_pre_element_a7d17dcc423a73264094066ec9b8fd66e_1a7d17dcc423a73264094066ec9b8fd66e" kindref="member">degree</ref>)</computeroutput> pair used during the pre-sort phase that feeds <computeroutput><ref refid="class_schreyer_frame_a6b0f9a04ba79d8abac92bb6bbeca97c1_1a6b0f9a04ba79d8abac92bb6bbeca97c1" kindref="member">SchreyerFrame::insertLevelZero</ref></computeroutput> / <computeroutput>insertLevelOne</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Smaller than a full <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_schreyer_frame_types_1_1_frame_element" kindref="compound">FrameElement</ref></computeroutput> <mdash/> no descendant slice, no syzygy polynomial <mdash/> so the resolution engine can collect and sort the prospective generators before deciding their final <computeroutput><ref refid="res-monomial-types_8hpp_a0ebe4a3f6e95e1de53e835b3db65b784_1a0ebe4a3f6e95e1de53e835b3db65b784" kindref="member">component_index</ref></computeroutput> ordering in the frame. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
